        {
          "id": "what-people-think-vs-what-really-happens",
          "title": "What people think vs what really happens",
          "description": "❌ What many owners think:",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "\"Supply only is cheaper because I can find a cheaper garage.\""
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "✅ Reality:"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Supply only may be cheaper upfront - but the total cost often exceeds supply & fit when you factor in:"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Garage markup on the engine (some garages add 10-20% to supply-only engines)",
                "Consumables (oil, coolant, filters, gaskets - often £200-£500 extra)",
                "Collection/delivery of the engine to your garage (£50-£200)",
                "Disposal of the old engine (£50-£150)",
                "Diagnostic time if issues arise during fitting",
                "Warranty disputes - if the engine fails, the supplier blames the fitter and vice versa"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "\"In real UK workshop practice, supply & fit packages often offer better value than separate arrangements when you factor in consumables, collection, disposal, and the simplified liability of a single point of contact.\" [EM-OBSERVED]"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Real-world example: Supply only: £2,000 engine + £800 labour + £300 consumables + £150 collection/disposal = £3,250 Supply & fit: £3,000 (often lower than the sum of separate parts)"
            },
            {
              "type": "label",
              "text": "Technical comparison"
            }
          ],
          "links": [],
          "source": {
            "sectionId": "what-people-think-vs-what-really-happens",
            "order": 2
